{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "Hey, you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "Hi!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "You want to get out?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "Then help me find the key!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "Shoot! No key here!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "Nothing here!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "Zero, zip, nada!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "Found it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "Huh, I thought you'd be shorter!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "Look how tall you are!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "You're just like my sister!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "Your... sister?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "Yes, my sister."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "Don't say you've never met her!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "\"Met her\"? That's one way to put it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "Are you stupid?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "Um..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "Turns out you are..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "Come on, just help me find the key already!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "Here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "Put the iron into the pipe!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "Thank you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "Now, get me that firewood, I can't reach it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "Much appreciated!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "Some more help over here, please!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "All done! Now..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "Look, this is so beautiful..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "Come on, press it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "Tadaa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "Here we go, you can have it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "The key is yours!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "I'm ChibiMita.fbx!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "Tons of lines,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "simplest armature, and—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "best of all—gorgeous hair!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "Mister sillyhead!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "You're kinda cute, you know,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "asking silly questions like that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "Nope,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "this is my first time meeting you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "But..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "But, if someone DID steal my marvelous looks,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "they should really feel ashamed!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "Don't you get it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "This is a checkpoint!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "\"Show me your wits!\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "\"You can pass!\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "I'm here to guide the hopelessly lost!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "What makes you so special"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "that you DON'T deserve help?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "What?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "You're so silly..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "Appearing out of nowhere like that!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "You're not supposed to be here,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "so, I'm helping you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "Bye-bye, sillyhead!"}
